# Environment variables live in per-package files so each part only sees what it needs:
#
#   backend/.env.example   API: database, JWT, CORS origins, email   (copy to backend/.env)
#   frontend/.env.example  Web app build settings (VITE_API_URL)      (copy to frontend/.env if needed)
#
# For Vercel, set the backend variables in Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
# For GitHub Pages, set VITE_API_URL as a repository Actions *variable*.
# Never commit real secrets.
